The  functions  are  designed  to copy small amounts of data from
user‐space.  The routines provide  the  following  functionality:
Fetches a byte of data from the user‐space address Fetches a byte
of data from the user‐space address This function is safe to call
during  an  interrupt  context.   Fetches a word of data from the
user‐space address This function is safe to call during an inter‐
rupt context.  Fetches a long word of data  from  the  user‐space
address  Fetches a unsigned long word of data from the user‐space
address Fetches a word of data from the  user‐space  address  The
functions return the data fetched or ‐1 on failure.
